    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a feeling though. it's like... when you look at a piece of glass that's been smashed into a million tiny pieces, you can glue it back together but the cracks are always there. it's never the same. i feel like that. i've been through so much for so long that there's nothing left to glue. i'm just tired of trying to be \"fixed\" when it's clearly impossible.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
