      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel this way when you've gone through so much; the weight of past hurts can feel permanent. Please allow yourself to stop trying to \"fix\" and, instead, try to just *be* in this moment, without the pressure of self-reconstruction. You don't have to be a perfect, whole self right now; it's okay to be in a state of brokenness, and self-compassion is an act of strength.",
      "source": "target",
