    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"just being\" is so exhausting. what if there's nothing left to \"be\"? it feels like i'm just waiting for the end because the version of me that was supposed to live a life is gone. staying like this, just being broken... it doesn't feel like strength. it just feels like a slow way to suffer. wouldn't it be more logical to just accept that it's over?",
